THE GAME

Ultima Underworld: The Stygian Abyss was developed by Blue Sky Productions (later Looking Glass Technologies) and published by Origin Systems in 1992. Its copyright belongs to its owners (Electronic Arts). Ultima and Ultima Underworld are trademarks of Electronic Arts.

The decompiled game code in this repository is derived from the game's program, UW.EXE. That is the game's C and assembly under src/, with the shared headers in src/include. The tables in map/, targets/ and symbols.tsv describe UW.EXE. This project claims no ownership of the game, and the MIT licence in LICENSE does not grant any right in it.

No game data is included: no executable, art, sound, map, text or other file of the game. To build anything you need your own copy of the game; the GOG release is the one the tools check for.

