OTHER CODE IN THE REPOSITORY

- src/lib/OVERLAY.ASM is Borland's VROOMM overlay manager, rebuilt from OVERLAY.LIB of Turbo C++ 1.01, which UW.EXE links. Its copyright belongs to its owner (Borland, now Embarcadero). The Turbo C++ and Turbo Assembler programs themselves are not included.
- src/sound/AIL.ASM is the Audio Interface Library API of John Miles (Miles Design), which its author released on 26 May 2000 as freeware "usable by anyone for any purpose, commercial or otherwise, without restriction or limitation", in effect public domain.
- tools/repocheck.py is from Exhume (https://github.com/abedegno/Exhume), under its MIT licence.
